 of my life."]}]},{"id":"bg_tourist","x":17,"y":31,"sprite":"man3","facing":"LEFT","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":["I followed the arrows to the safari. Turns out the arrows were just sticks.","Do you know the way back? Asking for a friend. The friend is me."]}]},{"id":"bg_botanist","x":20,"y":35,"sprite":"college_f","facing":"DOWN","movement":"IDLE","script":[{"say":["Wild jamun, sandalwood, bamboo, and a hundred plants with no English names.","The villagers know them all. I just have a very expensive notebook."]}]}],"signs":[{"x":13,"y":2,"style":"forest","text":"BANNERGHATTA FOREST - Elephant corridor. Walk, don't run. And definitely don't honk."},{"x":14,"y":17,"style":"forest","text":"STREAM AHEAD. Stepping stones are slippery. So are the Urumon."},{"x":23,"y":30,"style":"stone","text":"A view over the canopy. On a clear day you can see Bengaluru. On most days you see haze."}],"items":[{"id":"bg_dabba","x":27,"y":27,"item":"Dabba","qty":3},{"id":"bg_neem","x":3,"y":12,"item":"Neem Paste"},{"id":"bg_elaneer","x":27,"y":42,"item":"Elaneer","qty":2},{"id":"bg_coil","x":30,"y":11,"item":"Mosquito Coil","qty":2}],"triggers":[],"counters":[],"interactables":[{"x":20,"y":5,"script":[{"say":"Locked. A note on the door: 'On patrol. Back by tiffin time. Do NOT feed the elephants. - Ranger Thimmaiah'"}]}],"encounters":{},"water":[],"onEnter":null,"spawn":null,"metroStation":null,"respawnText":null}}